    "description": "2018. – Present: Principal Engineer at Samsung elec \n- Enterprise NVME SSD test on Server based\n- NVMe SSD FA supports for OEM (Mar.~ Dec. 2018, MA, USA)\n\n2013~2017 : Senior Engineer at Samsung elec. QA Team. \n- NVMe SSD Qualification for PRA(Product Release Approval) for NVMe SSD\n- Test design and Implementation for NVMe/SATA SSD (Technical Leader)\n\n2010 ~ 2013 : Senior Engineer at Samsung elec. SW Dev. Team\n* Design & Implementation with SSD FTL\n - PCIe SSD(NVMe 1.0b) Design for journaling and open for FTL\n - Fault analysis of SSD (DV, PV phase)\n\n2008 ~ 2009\n* Software Engineering\n - Development & update Software Process in Samsung electornics\n - PLM(Project Life Management) TF involved with S/W Development Process\n - Audit for S/W Development Project \n\n2002 ~ 2007\n* Performance and Fault analysis with modeling of MMC\n- To figure out bottle neck of MMC FTL. make Test case for stress test.\n- Modeling only (without FTL background knowledge)\n\n* Cross-layer QoS control for wireless LAN video streaming\n- PHY/MAC control in a Linux device driver\n- MPEG video codec control in Linux VideoLAN application \n- QoE measurement system implementation",
